ision (AMP), and early stopping (patience=3 on validation log loss). Use stratified 80/15/5? Actually use 5-fold cross-validation? Use a single 85/15 stratified split for efficiency. Why: The successful historical experiment used this training recipe; it directly optimizes the classification loss and avoids the two-stage separation. How: Implement a PyTorch training loop with the described components, evaluate on validation set each epoch, save best model, and generate test predictions with clipped softmax probabilities. Interface: train function receives model, dataloaders, and device; returns trained model and validation scores."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
